+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>My CI pipeline has a better success rate than my alarm clock.</p></div>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">AI, today</span><p>AI is great for scripts, configs and debugging error messages, but it happily suggests insecure shortcuts. Security and operations still need a human who understands the risks.</p></div>
