+        <div class="card-body"><p class="interests"><strong>Into:</strong> Frontend and UI design, photography, and badminton.</p>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>I spend more time picking a colour palette than writing the actual code.</p></div>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">AI, today</span><p>AI can produce a working UI in minutes, but "working" and "pleasant to use" are not the same thing. It still needs a human eye for design, accessibility and the small details users notice.</p></div>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">In 5–10 years</span><p>Building software will feel more like directing than typing. Taste, user empathy and clear communication will matter more than knowing a framework.</p></div>
