+        <div class="card-body"><p class="interests"><strong>Into:</strong> Building side projects, cricket, and late-night debugging sessions with too much chai.</p>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>I once fixed a production bug from my phone while waiting in a supermarket queue.</p></div>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">AI, today</span><p>AI assistants are great at boilerplate and first drafts, but they still need someone who understands the system to check their work. They speed me up most when I already know what I want.</p></div>
