+        <div class="card-body"><p class="interests"><strong>Into:</strong> Machine learning, football, and cooking dishes my mother would not approve of.</p>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>I have more half-finished ML side projects than finished meals this semester.</p></div>
+          <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">AI, today</span><p>The models are surprisingly good at explaining code and writing tests, but they are weak at understanding why a system was built the way it was. They work best when the human brings the context.</p></div>
